---
title: "publishRaisedCapital (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_caller: Legion operator publishes raised capital
    q_check_caller --> q_check_ended: caller is Legion operator
    q_check_caller --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_check_ended --> q_check_refund: hasEnded == true
    q_check_ended --> q_revert_not_ended: sale not ended
    q_check_refund --> q_check_not_published: block.timestamp >= refundEndTime
    q_check_refund --> q_revert_refund: refund period not ended
    q_check_not_published --> q_publish: raised capital not yet published
    q_check_not_published --> q_revert_published: already published
    q_publish --> [*]: totalCapitalRaised = _totalCapitalRaised, emit RaisedCapitalPublished(_totalCapitalRaised)
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_revert_not_ended --> [*]: revert SaleNotEnded
    q_revert_refund --> [*]: revert RefundPeriodNotEnded
    q_revert_published --> [*]: revert AlreadyPublished

    note right of q_publish
        INV-001: Published after all individual refund windows have closed
        INV-002: totalCapitalRaised reflects post-refund capital amount
    end note
